  "description": "🐶 A playful collection of watercolor dog clipart featuring adorable pups getting into trouble, making messes, stealing socks, chasing sticks, and showing off their goofy personalities. Designed in a soft, modern watercolor style with expressive faces, charming poses, and a variety of dog breeds, this collection captures the everyday chaos and joy of life with dogs.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on Demand products\n• Stickers and sticker sheets\n• Pet-themed merchandise\n• Scrapbooking projects\n• Planners and journals\n• Greeting cards and invitations\n• Digital and printable crafts\n💖 What’s included:\n– 19 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 19 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 19 SVG files\n🐾 Included illustrations:\npuppy stealing a sock, puppy tangled in a sweater, dog with head in a treat bag, golden retriever in a muddy puddle, corgi barking at a leaf, dog tangled in a leash, corgi sploot pose, dachshund dragging a slipper, wet poodle after a bath, puppy sleeping in a laundry basket, dog with tennis balls, puppy with unraveled toilet paper, french bulldog hiding with a croissant, tiny dog in an oversized raincoat, upside-down sleeping spaniel, puppy tangled in gift ribbon, labrador beside an empty food bowl, dog carrying a giant stick, corgi with a favorite toy.\n✨ Featuring golden retrievers, corgis, dachshunds, poodles, beagles, labradors, spaniels, terriers, french bulldogs, and mixed-breed puppies, this collection celebrates the funny, chaotic, and lovable moments that make dogs so special. With expressive personalities, cozy watercolor textures, and heartwarming everyday scenes, these illustrations are perfect for dog lovers and pet-themed creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>🐶 A playful collection of watercolor dog clipart featuring adorable pups getting into trouble, making messes, stealing socks, chasing sticks, and showing off their goofy personalities. Designed in a soft, modern watercolor style with expressive faces, charming poses, and a variety of dog breeds, this collection captures the everyday chaos and joy of life with dogs.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on Demand products<br>\n• Stickers and sticker sheets<br>\n• Pet-themed merchandise<br>\n• Scrapbooking projects<br>\n• Planners and journals<br>\n• Greeting cards and invitations<br>\n• Digital and printable crafts</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 19 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 19 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 19 SVG files</p>\n<p>🐾 Included illustrations:<br>\npuppy stealing a sock, puppy tangled in a sweater, dog with head in a treat bag, golden retriever in a muddy puddle, corgi barking at a leaf, dog tangled in a leash, corgi sploot pose, dachshund dragging a slipper, wet poodle after a bath, puppy sleeping in a laundry basket, dog with tennis balls, puppy with unraveled toilet paper, french bulldog hiding with a croissant, tiny dog in an oversized raincoat, upside-down sleeping spaniel, puppy tangled in gift ribbon, labrador beside an empty food bowl, dog carrying a giant stick, corgi with a favorite toy.</p>\n<p>✨ Featuring golden retrievers, corgis, dachshunds, poodles, beagles, labradors, spaniels, terriers, french bulldogs, and mixed-breed puppies, this collection celebrates the funny, chaotic, and lovable moments that make dogs so special. With expressive personalities, cozy watercolor textures, and heartwarming everyday scenes, these illustrations are perfect for dog lovers and pet-themed creative projects.</p>",
